{"seq":3,"slug":"nova-supernova-physics","title":"新星与超新星物理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars/nova-supernova-physics","wordCount":2607,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"新星与超新星物理\">新星与超新星物理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>恒星爆发按能量尺度与物理机制分为多个层次，核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>爆发层次</strong>：从矮新星（吸积盘热不稳定）到经典/再发新星（WD 表面热核爆炸）、Ia 型超新星（WD 整体热核爆炸）、核坍缩超新星（铁核坍缩）</li>\n<li><strong>热失控（TNR）</strong>：简并吸积层底部温度上升不引起膨胀 → 正反馈，是白矮星表面新星爆发的条件</li>\n<li><strong>标准烛光</strong>：Ia 型超新星经 Phillips 宽度-光度关系标准化后弥散约 0.12 等，是发现宇宙加速膨胀的关键工具</li>\n<li><strong>爆燃与爆轰</strong>：热核火焰的传播模式（纯爆燃/纯爆轰/延迟爆轰 DDT）决定元素合成产物</li>\n<li><strong>核坍缩能量学</strong>：约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>53</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times10^{53}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">53</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> erg 的引力能以中微子形式逃逸，仅约 1% 被用于驱动爆炸</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"热核爆发的分类体系\">热核爆发的分类体系</h2><p>恒星爆发现象按能量尺度和物理机制分为多个层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>典型能量 (erg)</th>\n<th>光度峰值</th>\n<th>物理机制</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>矮新星</td>\n<td>~10³⁸</td>\n<td>数等增亮</td>\n<td>吸积盘热不稳定</td>\n<td>周–月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经典新星</td>\n<td>10⁴³–10⁴⁶</td>\n<td>M_V ~ −7 到 −10</td>\n<td>WD表面热核爆炸</td>\n<td>10⁴ yr/系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>再发新星</td>\n<td>~10⁴³</td>\n<td>M_V ~ −7</td>\n<td>大质量WD上的新星</td>\n<td>1–80 yr</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ia型超新星</td>\n<td>~10⁵¹</td>\n<td>M_V ~ −19.3</td>\n<td>WD整体热核爆炸</td>\n<td>~10⁻³ yr/星系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核坍缩超新星</td>\n<td>~3×10⁵³ (ν)</td>\n<td>M_V ~ −17 到 −18</td>\n<td>铁核坍缩+反弹</td>\n<td>~10⁻² yr/星系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"经典新星-classical-novae\">经典新星（Classical Novae）</h2><h3 id=\"物理机制\">物理机制</h3><p>经典新星发生在<strong>激变变星</strong>（Cataclysmic Variable, CV）系统中：白矮星从伴星吸积富氢物质。当吸积层底部温度和密度达到临界值时，氢通过CNO循环发生热核爆发——<strong>热失控</strong>（Thermonuclear Runaway, TNR）。</p>\n<p>爆发条件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>临界吸积质量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta M_{ign} \\sim 10^{-5} - 10^{-4} M_\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0224em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（取决于WD质量和吸积率）</li>\n<li>底部温度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≳</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{base} \\gtrsim 2 \\times 10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> K</li>\n<li>简并条件：吸积层底部处于简并态 → 温度上升不引起膨胀 → 正反馈</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"新星光变曲线\">新星光变曲线</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[宁静态&lt;br/&gt;吸积中] --&gt;|10⁴yr积累| B[热核点燃&lt;br/&gt;小时尺度]&#10;    B --&gt; C[快速升亮&lt;br/&gt;1-3天]&#10;    C --&gt; D[光极大&lt;br/&gt;M~-7到-10]&#10;    D --&gt; E[早期下降&lt;br/&gt;风/抛射物主导]&#10;    E --&gt; F[过渡期&lt;br/&gt;尘埃形成?]&#10;    F --&gt; G[星云期&lt;br/&gt;抛射物膨胀]&#10;    G --&gt; H[恢复宁静&lt;br/&gt;重新吸积]\">graph LR\n    A[宁静态&lt;br/&gt;吸积中] --&gt;|10⁴yr积累| B[热核点燃&lt;br/&gt;小时尺度]\n    B --&gt; C[快速升亮&lt;br/&gt;1-3天]\n    C --&gt; D[光极大&lt;br/&gt;M~-7到-10]\n    D --&gt; E[早期下降&lt;br/&gt;风/抛射物主导]\n    E --&gt; F[过渡期&lt;br/&gt;尘埃形成?]\n    F --&gt; G[星云期&lt;br/&gt;抛射物膨胀]\n    G --&gt; H[恢复宁静&lt;br/&gt;重新吸积]</pre><h3 id=\"新星速度分类\">新星速度分类</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>速度类</th>\n<th>t₂（下降2等时间）</th>\n<th>典型 M_V</th>\n<th>WD质量</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>&lt; 10天</td>\n<td>−9 到 −10</td>\n<td>&gt; 1.2 M☉</td>\n<td>V838 Her</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>10–25天</td>\n<td>−8 到 −9</td>\n<td>1.0–1.2 M☉</td>\n<td>V1500 Cyg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中速</td>\n<td>25–80天</td>\n<td>−7 到 −8</td>\n<td>0.7–1.0 M☉</td>\n<td>DQ Her</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>&gt; 80天</td>\n<td>−6 到 −7</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.7 M☉</td>\n<td>HR Del</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>新星的最大亮度-下降速率关系（MMRD）：下降越快的新星光度峰值越高——因为更大质量的WD需要更少的吸积物质即可触发爆发，爆发更剧烈。</p>\n<h3 id=\"新星核合成\">新星核合成</h3><p>新星爆发的温度条件允许CNO循环及以上的核反应进行，产生特征性核合成产物：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>¹³C, ¹⁵N, ¹⁷O（CNO循环中间产物）</li>\n<li>²²Na（产生1.275 MeV γ射线）</li>\n<li>²⁶Al（产生1.809 MeV γ射线）</li>\n<li>⁷Li（通过 ³He + ⁴He → ⁷Be → ⁷Li）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>新星是宇宙中锂和部分放射性同位素的重要来源之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ia型超新星\">Ia型超新星</h2><h3 id=\"物理机制与前身系统\">物理机制与前身系统</h3><p>Ia型超新星是宇宙学中最重要的标准烛光之一。其光谱特征为：无氢线、有强硅吸收线（Si II 6150 Å）。物理机制为碳-氧白矮星的整体热核爆炸。</p>\n<p>关于前身系统，存在两种主要模型：</p>\n<p><strong>单简并模型（SD）</strong>：白矮星从非简并伴星吸积物质，质量增长至接近钱德拉塞卡极限 → 中心碳点燃 → 热核爆轰</p>\n<p><strong>双简并模型（DD）</strong>：两颗白矮星通过引力波辐射损失能量，轨道收缩至并合 → 总质量超过极限 → 爆炸</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比较维度</th>\n<th>单简并模型</th>\n<th>双简并模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前身系统</td>\n<td>WD + 主序/巨星</td>\n<td>WD + WD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发条件</td>\n<td>接近 M_Ch</td>\n<td>总质量 &gt; M_Ch 或 sub-M_Ch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟时间</td>\n<td>可短可长</td>\n<td>通常较长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伴星证据</td>\n<td>极少观测确认</td>\n<td>无需伴星存活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支持证据</td>\n<td>再发新星、超软X射线源</td>\n<td>延迟时间分布、无氢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>目前的共识是两种通道<strong>均贡献</strong>Ia型超新星的产率，但各自的比例仍有争议。</p>\n<h3 id=\"爆燃与爆轰\">爆燃与爆轰</h3><p>热核火焰在白矮星内部的传播模式决定了爆炸特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传播模式</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯爆燃（Deflagration）</td>\n<td>&lt; 声速</td>\n<td>预膨胀、混合</td>\n<td>⁵⁶Ni产量太低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯爆轰（Detonation）</td>\n<td>&gt; 声速</td>\n<td>全部烧为铁族</td>\n<td>无中间质量元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟爆轰（DDT）</td>\n<td>先燃后轰</td>\n<td>兼有两者优点</td>\n<td>DDT转变条件不确定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>延迟爆轰模型</strong>（Delayed Detonation）是目前最成功的Ia超新星爆炸模型：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>核心碳点燃后以亚声速爆燃传播</li>\n<li>恒星预膨胀降低密度</li>\n<li>火焰在某一密度下转变为超声速爆轰</li>\n<li>爆轰烧尽剩余物质</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ia超新星的光变曲线\">Ia超新星的光变曲线</h3><p>光变曲线峰值主要由 ⁵⁶Ni 衰变链提供能量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>56</mn></msup><mtext>Ni</mtext><msup><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mn>6.1</mn><mtext>天</mtext></mrow></mpadded></mover><mn>56</mn></msup><mtext>Co</mtext><msup><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mn>77.3</mn><mtext>天</mtext></mrow></mpadded></mover><mn>56</mn></msup><mtext>Fe</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{56}\\text{Ni} \\xrightarrow{6.1\\text{天}} ^{56}\\text{Co} \\xrightarrow{77.3\\text{天}} ^{56}\\text{Fe}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3153em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">56</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ni</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6.1</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">天</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3043em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.5532em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">56</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3153em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Co</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">77.3</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">天</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3043em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.5532em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">56</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Fe</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Phillips关系（宽度-光度关系）：下降越慢的Ia超新星峰值越亮</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>19.3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>15</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1.1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_B^{max} = -19.3 + \\alpha (\\Delta m_{15} - 1.1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9614em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">19.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>15</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta m_{15}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为峰值后15天的B波段星等下降量。经过标准化后，Ia超新星的绝对星等弥散可控制在 ~0.12等——使其成为精确的标准烛光。</p>\n<h3 id=\"宇宙加速膨胀的发现\">宇宙加速膨胀的发现</h3><p>1998年，Supernova Cosmology Project和High-z Supernova Search Team独立利用Ia超新星测距发现远处超新星比预期更暗——宇宙膨胀在加速。这一发现暗示宇宙中存在暗能量，获2011年诺贝尔物理学奖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核坍缩超新星-core-collapse-supernovae-ccsne\">核坍缩超新星（Core-Collapse Supernovae, CCSNe）</h2><h3 id=\"分类与光谱\">分类与光谱</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>光谱特征</th>\n<th>前身星</th>\n<th>爆发机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Type II-P</td>\n<td>氢线、光变平台期</td>\n<td>红超巨星（保留H包层）</td>\n<td>核坍缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Type II-L</td>\n<td>氢线、线性下降</td>\n<td>黄超巨星</td>\n<td>核坍缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Type IIn</td>\n<td>窄氢发射线</td>\n<td>有密集星周介质的巨星</td>\n<td>核坍缩+CSM相互作用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Type IIb</td>\n<td>初期有氢、后期无</td>\n<td>部分剥离H包层</td>\n<td>核坍缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Type Ib</td>\n<td>无氢、有氦线</td>\n<td>Wolf-Rayet (WN)</td>\n<td>核坍缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Type Ic</td>\n<td>无氢无氦</td>\n<td>Wolf-Rayet (WC/WO)</td>\n<td>核坍缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Type Ic-BL</td>\n<td>宽线（高速抛射物）</td>\n<td>致密大质量星</td>\n<td>核坍缩+发动机</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"爆炸能量学\">爆炸能量学</h3><p>核坍缩超新星的能量预算：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能量分量</th>\n<th>数值 (erg)</th>\n<th>比例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中微子动能</td>\n<td>~3 × 10⁵³</td>\n<td>~99%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抛射物动能</td>\n<td>~10⁵¹</td>\n<td>~0.3%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电磁辐射</td>\n<td>~10⁴⁹</td>\n<td>~0.03%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引力波</td>\n<td>~10⁴⁶–10⁴⁷</td>\n<td>&lt;0.01%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心坍缩释放的引力能约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>53</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 10^{53}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">53</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> erg，其中绝大部分以中微子形式逃逸。仅需将约1%的中微子能量传递给外层即可驱动成功的爆炸——这正是&quot;中微子驱动机制&quot;需要解决的核心效率问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"超新星残骸与核合成\">超新星残骸与核合成</h3><p>超新星爆发将重元素抛射到星际介质中，是宇宙化学演化的核心引擎：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核合成过程</th>\n<th>产物</th>\n<th>发生区域</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>爆炸性氧/硅燃烧</td>\n<td>Si, S, Ca, Ti</td>\n<td>内层抛射物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>α-rich freeze-out</td>\n<td>⁵⁶Ni（衰变为铁）</td>\n<td>最内层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>r-过程（快中子俘获）</td>\n<td>稀土、锕系元素</td>\n<td>中子星风/并合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ν-过程</td>\n<td>⁷Li, ¹¹B, ¹⁹F</td>\n<td>中微子辐照区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[核坍缩超新星残骸] --&gt; B[超新星遗迹 SNR&lt;br/&gt;抛射物+激波&lt;br/&gt;X射线/射电可见]&#10;    A --&gt; C[致密残骸&lt;br/&gt;中子星或黑洞]&#10;    B --&gt; D[自由膨胀期&lt;br/&gt;t &lt; 数百yr&lt;br/&gt;v~10⁴ km/s]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Sedov-Taylor期&lt;br/&gt;t ~ 10²-10⁴ yr&lt;br/&gt;绝热减速]&#10;    E --&gt; F[辐射冷却期&lt;br/&gt;t &gt; 10⁴ yr&lt;br/&gt;薄壳形成]&#10;    F --&gt; G[消散融入ISM&lt;br/&gt;t ~ 10⁵-10⁶ yr]\">graph TD\n    A[核坍缩超新星残骸] --&gt; B[超新星遗迹 SNR&lt;br/&gt;抛射物+激波&lt;br/&gt;X射线/射电可见]\n    A --&gt; C[致密残骸&lt;br/&gt;中子星或黑洞]\n    B --&gt; D[自由膨胀期&lt;br/&gt;t &lt; 数百yr&lt;br/&gt;v~10⁴ km/s]\n    D --&gt; E[Sedov-Taylor期&lt;br/&gt;t ~ 10²-10⁴ yr&lt;br/&gt;绝热减速]\n    E --&gt; F[辐射冷却期&lt;br/&gt;t &gt; 10⁴ yr&lt;br/&gt;薄壳形成]\n    F --&gt; G[消散融入ISM&lt;br/&gt;t ~ 10⁵-10⁶ yr]</pre><h2 id=\"超亮超新星-superluminous-supernovae-slsne\">超亮超新星（Superluminous Supernovae, SLSNe）</h2><p>超亮超新星的峰值光度超过普通超新星10–100倍（M_V &lt; −21），其能源机制尚在探讨中：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>物理机制</th>\n<th>特征预测</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>磁星驱动</td>\n<td>毫秒脉冲星的自转能注入</td>\n<td>宽光变峰值、蓝色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSM相互作用</td>\n<td>抛射物与密集星周介质碰撞</td>\n<td>窄发射线、慢衰减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对不稳定</td>\n<td>极大质量恒星的对产生</td>\n<td>大量⁵⁶Ni、无残骸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"最新研究进展\">最新研究进展</h2><h3 id=\"再发新星t-crb的预期爆发-2024-2025\">再发新星T CrB的预期爆发（2024–2025）</h3><p>再发新星北冕座T（T Coronae Borealis）的上一次爆发为1946年。根据其~80年的爆发周期和光变曲线前兆行为，天文学界高度关注其在2024–2025年可能发生的新一次爆发，将提供罕见的近距离再发新星多波段详细观测机会。</p>\n<h3 id=\"jwst对近邻超新星残骸的精细结构\">JWST对近邻超新星残骸的精细结构</h3><p>JWST的中红外观测揭示了仙后座A（Cas A）等年轻超新星残骸中尘粒的详细空间分布和化学组成。数据表明超新星是宇宙尘埃的重要来源——每次核坍缩超新星可产生0.1–1 M☉的尘埃。</p>\n<h3 id=\"超新星早期闪光与前身星限制\">超新星早期闪光与前身星限制</h3><p>通过巡天望远镜（ZTF、Rubin/LSST）在爆发后数小时内捕获的早期闪光数据（shock breakout 和 cooling envelope emission），天文学家能够约束前身星的半径和星周介质密度，为超新星前身星问题提供直接观测约束。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ia超新星前身系统的新线索\">Ia超新星前身系统的新线索</h3><p>2024–2025年对多颗Ia超新星极早期光谱的研究发现了伴星交互作用的微弱信号——在光变曲线极早期（爆发后数小时）观测到的过量蓝色辐射，与抛射物撞击非简并伴星的理论预期一致，为单简并通道提供了间接支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>恒星爆发按能量尺度分层：矮新星（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>38</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{38}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">38</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> erg，吸积盘热不稳定）、经典/再发新星（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>43</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{43}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">43</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>46</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{46}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">46</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> erg，白矮星表面热核爆炸）、Ia 型超新星（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>51</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{51}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">51</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> erg，WD 整体爆炸）与核坍缩超新星（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>53</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times10^{53}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">53</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> erg，铁核坍缩）。</li>\n<li>经典新星依赖简并吸积层底部的热失控（TNR）：温度上升不引起膨胀，形成正反馈，其光变-下降速率关系（MMRD）反映 WD 质量。</li>\n<li>Ia 型超新星的物理核心是热核火焰的传播模式，延迟爆轰（DDT）模型兼顾了预膨胀与充分核合成；Phillips 关系把峰值亮度与下降速率关联后，其弥散被压到约 0.12 等，成为宇宙加速膨胀的发现工具。</li>\n<li>核坍缩超新星的能量几乎全部由中微子带走（约 99%），&quot;中微子驱动机制&quot;的效率问题与超新星残骸的核合成（爆炸性氧/硅燃烧、r-过程、ν-过程）是理解宇宙化学演化的关键。</li>\n<li>再发新星 T CrB 的预期爆发、JWST 对残骸尘粒的观测、超新星早期闪光与 Ia 前身系统线索，共同构成当前这一领域最活跃的观测前沿。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"新星与超新星物理","id":"新星与超新星物理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"热核爆发的分类体系","id":"热核爆发的分类体系"},{"level":2,"text":"经典新星（Classical Novae）","id":"经典新星-classical-novae"},{"level":3,"text":"物理机制","id":"物理机制"},{"level":3,"text":"新星光变曲线","id":"新星光变曲线"},{"level":3,"text":"新星速度分类","id":"新星速度分类"},{"level":3,"text":"新星核合成","id":"新星核合成"},{"level":2,"text":"Ia型超新星","id":"ia型超新星"},{"level":3,"text":"物理机制与前身系统","id":"物理机制与前身系统"},{"level":3,"text":"爆燃与爆轰","id":"爆燃与爆轰"},{"level":3,"text":"Ia超新星的光变曲线","id":"ia超新星的光变曲线"},{"level":3,"text":"宇宙加速膨胀的发现","id":"宇宙加速膨胀的发现"},{"level":2,"text":"核坍缩超新星（Core-Collapse Supernovae, CCSNe）","id":"核坍缩超新星-core-collapse-supernovae-ccsne"},{"level":3,"text":"分类与光谱","id":"分类与光谱"},{"level":3,"text":"爆炸能量学","id":"爆炸能量学"},{"level":3,"text":"超新星残骸与核合成","id":"超新星残骸与核合成"},{"level":2,"text":"超亮超新星（Superluminous Supernovae, SLSNe）","id":"超亮超新星-superluminous-supernovae-slsne"},{"level":2,"text":"最新研究进展","id":"最新研究进展"},{"level":3,"text":"再发新星T CrB的预期爆发（2024–2025）","id":"再发新星t-crb的预期爆发-2024-2025"},{"level":3,"text":"JWST对近邻超新星残骸的精细结构","id":"jwst对近邻超新星残骸的精细结构"},{"level":3,"text":"超新星早期闪光与前身星限制","id":"超新星早期闪光与前身星限制"},{"level":3,"text":"Ia超新星前身系统的新线索","id":"ia超新星前身系统的新线索"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"变星分类与测距","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars/variable-star-classes"},"next":{"title":"分子云坍缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/star-formation/molecular-cloud-collapse"}}